<title>UK: SBC sets call, put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call, put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 18 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one index.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	23.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $700.64</p>
<p> WARRANTS	 STRIKE     ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	  GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	   $700.00    8.10 SFR	 9.13 PCT     10.85 X</p>
<p> CALL B	   $720.00    6.64 SFR	10.31 PCT     13.24 X</p>
<p> CALL C	   $740.00    5.33 SFR	11.70 PCT     16.45 X</p>
<p> PUT D	    $700.00    4.69 SFR     - 5.43 PCT     18.73 X</p>
<p> PUT E	    $720.00    5.72 SFR     - 3.73 PCT     15.40 X</p>
<p> PUT F	    $740.00    6.98 SFR     - 2.33 PCT     12.58 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
